9. AI Reflection cực đẹp
The initial undo implementation only supported reversing recently added transactions.

To improve functionality, the system was redesigned using an Action-based Undo mechanism.

Instead of storing only transactions, the stack now stores action types and related transaction data.

This design allows the system to undo both ADD and DELETE operations while improving scalability for future features such as UPDATE undo.

